          "author": "Slumberkins",
          "description": "It’s never too early to teach children about mindfulness! Whether your kids are at home, on the go, or at school, these mini meditations are an easy way to get children to calm their active bodies alongside fun and friendly sea creatures. Each meditation was developed by therapists and educators at Slumberkins, the leading brand for early emotional learning.   \n\nThis series of Mini Meditations includes:   \n• Deep Breathing with Narwhal \n• Explore the Senses with Jellyfish \n• Flex your Muscles with Crab  \n• Listen and Imagine with Manta Ray",
